  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">FAQ</span>
        <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What is the best online booking system for salons and barbershops in Canada?</summary>
          <p>Bookwize is an all-in-one online booking and CRM platform built for salons, barbershops, spas, and service businesses across Canada, including Montreal. It features 24/7 online scheduling, staff management, automated email reminders, white-label branding, and embeddable booking widgets. Plans start at $19/month or $299 one-time.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How does online appointment booking work with Bookwize?</summary>
          <p>Clients visit your branded Bookwize booking page, choose a service and staff member, select an available date and time, and confirm their appointment. You receive an instant notification and the client gets an email confirmation with a calendar invite. No app download or account creation is required for clients.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How long does it take to set up a booking system?</summary>
          <p>Most businesses are live within 5 minutes. Add your services, set your business hours, invite your team, and share your booking link. That's it — no technical knowledge required.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does Bookwize send appointment reminders to reduce no-shows?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Bookwize automatically sends email confirmations when a booking is made and reminders 24 hours before the appointment. This significantly reduces no-shows and keeps your schedule full. SMS reminders are available on paid plans.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I customize and white-label my booking page?</summary>
          <p>Absolutely. Bookwize offers full white-label branding — set your own colors, logo, fonts, and business name. Your booking page will look like it was built just for your business, with no Bookwize branding visible to your clients.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I embed the booking widget on my existing website?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Bookwize provides an embed code you can drop into any website. It works on WordPress, Squarespace, Wix, Shopify, and any custom-built site. You can also share a direct booking link on Instagram, Google, or add a QR code to your business card.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can my clients book without downloading an app?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Clients simply visit your booking page, enter their name, email, and phone number, and confirm their appointment. No signup, no app download, and no account creation required.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does Bookwize work for businesses with multiple staff or locations?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Bookwize supports multiple staff members, each with their own schedule, services, and availability. The Team plan supports up to 5 staff. Multi-location management is also available, letting you run everything from a single dashboard.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

